{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03517",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.4,
      "end_seconds": 4.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.44,
      "end_seconds": 9.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.63,
      "end_seconds": 19.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a painful ulcer that is growing quickly, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.14,
      "end_seconds": 24.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.09,
      "end_seconds": 27.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "It's been like this since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.45,
      "end_seconds": 33.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.08,
      "end_seconds": 44.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "I'd call it severe and starting as a pimple, too i had severe pain before that's settled now, though"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.97,
      "end_seconds": 47.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Any recent cut, recent injury or diabetes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.65,
      "end_seconds": 50.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.1,
      "end_seconds": 53.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.32,
      "end_seconds": 60.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.74,
      "end_seconds": 65.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Okay, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.62,
      "end_seconds": 69.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.07,
      "end_seconds": 72.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.27,
      "end_seconds": 76.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.05,
      "end_seconds": 95.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.42,
      "end_seconds": 103.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "I had my tonsils removed as a teenager"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.25,
      "end_seconds": 125.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.63,
      "end_seconds": 137.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "I have an irregular heartbeat, for nearly five years. I've got depression. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.68,
      "end_seconds": 142.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.71,
      "end_seconds": 155.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.48,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.87,
      "end_seconds": 159.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.62,
      "end_seconds": 164.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Wheat. I come out in... well, bloating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.41,
      "end_seconds": 185.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "alright, which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.01,
      "end_seconds": 191.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I'm on warfarin, 3 milligrams, in the evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.49,
      "end_seconds": 193.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "I see, go ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.34,
      "end_seconds": 198.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "it's mirtazapine, 15 milligrams, at night"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.46,
      "end_seconds": 202.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.72,
      "end_seconds": 218.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.12,
      "end_seconds": 238.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, respiratory rate 18. And temp 37.0 degrees, blood pressure 122 over 74, pulse is 69 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.32,
      "end_seconds": 240.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.44,
      "end_seconds": 244.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.66,
      "end_seconds": 251.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.92,
      "end_seconds": 256.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Yeah, um, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.51,
      "end_seconds": 260.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.64,
      "end_seconds": 285.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "The ulcer has a ragged purple edge with a boggy base and undermined borders."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.15,
      "end_seconds": 288.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.66,
      "end_seconds": 301.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.55,
      "text": "so, you can relax now. So where does that leave us? This looks most like possible pyoderma gangrenosum linked to bowel inflammation"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.92,
      "end_seconds": 304.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.61,
      "end_seconds": 322.4,
      "duration_seconds": 16.79,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible pyoderma gangrenosum linked to bowel inflammation, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. I'm sending you for blood tests because of ulcer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.13,
      "end_seconds": 326.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Hmm, okay, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.35,
      "end_seconds": 338.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.07,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a skin biopsy for rapidly enlarging ulcer that will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.34,
      "end_seconds": 341.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.63,
      "end_seconds": 364.3,
      "duration_seconds": 21.67,
      "text": "Do not cut or scrub it, that can make it worse. Let's get you seen by the dermatology clinic, I'll arrange the letter. If it hasn't settled in two weeks, we'd think about a stool test, but not now. Come back after the biopsy. Right, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.23,
      "end_seconds": 368.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.41,
      "end_seconds": 371.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}